Ahhh. Yes. The default with proximity data in secr >= 4.0 is to collapse to a single occasion, for speed. This precludes certain time-dependent models, including Bk. To revert to the old behaviour set details(fastproximity = FALSE). See secr-version4.pdf <https://www.otago.ac.nz/density/pdfs/secr-version4.pdf>.

